{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreadpine is a horror game set in a dark, corrupted forest. A relentless creature lurks in the shadows, twisting the world into eternal night, looking for you. Light is your only defense as you explore, scavenge and craft to survive the hunt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the forest shrouded in unending darkness</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a hostile wilderness where the laws of nature have been warped. The once-living forest now lies in decay, consumed by an unnatural darkness. Strange formations twist the trees, and eerie sounds echo through the night, warning of dangers lurking just out of sight. As you navigate through this ever-changing environment, you\u2019ll need to stay alert, because in this forest, you are never truly alone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514040/extras/6717537981a1fa2bc74e5b1d39d7712d.avif?t=1771784596\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514040/extras_big/6717537981a1fa2bc74e5b1d39d7712d.avif?t=1771784596 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Protect your home</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dreadpine you will have a cabin as your safe heaven, this is where you can craft and keep the campfire going. It's important to keep the campfire going for protection against what's lurking in the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514040/extras/d5f4f5a69673e80e4fd42aaf8b9a719a.avif?t=1771784596\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514040/extras_big/d5f4f5a69673e80e4fd42aaf8b9a719a.avif?t=1771784596 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scavenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival means making use of whatever you can find in the darkness. Search crash sites for supplies left behind, loot the remains of those who came before you, and salvage resources like wood, the further you are from the cabin the better stuff you will find but it makes sure you have enough light sources with you to make the journey.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514040/extras/66a3e24e1367b67a6cad943af129fed5.avif?t=1771784596\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514040/extras_big/66a3e24e1367b67a6cad943af129fed5.avif?t=1771784596 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the stuff you found around the forest you will have the ability to craft different kind of items, including new light sources, protection and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514040/extras/351f23fc6b10e4b180c636b6e762c099.avif?t=1771784596\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514040/extras_big/351f23fc6b10e4b180c636b6e762c099.avif?t=1771784596 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3514040?t=1771784596","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514040/fc4b283b727c2c101b27bc1828b3962d266b5079/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771784596","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514040/976adee5cbdf8f217b673c63f0551ccbb7e61827/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771784596","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514040/976adee5cbdf8f217b673c63f0551ccbb7e61827/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771784596","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreadpine is a horror game set in a dark, corrupted forest. A relentless creature lurks in the shadows, twisting the world into eternal night, looking for you. Light is your only defense as you explore, scavenge and craft to survive the hunt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the forest shrouded in unending darkness</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a hostile wilderness where the laws of nature have been warped. The once-living forest now lies in decay, consumed by an unnatural darkness. Strange formations twist the trees, and eerie sounds echo through the night, warning of dangers lurking just out of sight. As you navigate through this ever-changing environment, you\u2019ll need to stay alert, because in this forest, you are never truly alone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514040/extras/6717537981a1fa2bc74e5b1d39d7712d.avif?t=1771784596\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514040/extras_big/6717537981a1fa2bc74e5b1d39d7712d.avif?t=1771784596 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Protect your home</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dreadpine you will have a cabin as your safe heaven, this is where you can craft and keep the campfire going. It's important to keep the campfire going for protection against what's lurking in the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514040/extras/d5f4f5a69673e80e4fd42aaf8b9a719a.avif?t=1771784596\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514040/extras_big/d5f4f5a69673e80e4fd42aaf8b9a719a.avif?t=1771784596 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scavenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival means making use of whatever you can find in the darkness. Search crash sites for supplies left behind, loot the remains of those who came before you, and salvage resources like wood, the further you are from the cabin the better stuff you will find but it makes sure you have enough light sources with you to make the journey.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514040/extras/66a3e24e1367b67a6cad943af129fed5.avif?t=1771784596\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514040/extras_big/66a3e24e1367b67a6cad943af129fed5.avif?t=1771784596 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the stuff you found around the forest you will have the ability to craft different kind of items, including new light sources, protection and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514040/extras/351f23fc6b10e4b180c636b6e762c099.avif?t=1771784596\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514040/extras_big/351f23fc6b10e4b180c636b6e762c099.avif?t=1771784596 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","developers":["Red Stray Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste